# carry-subtick-corpus.manifest — rows for scripts/check_carry_subtick.sh.
# Row grammar and the instrument: see games/spyro-2/carry-subtick-corpus.manifest.
#
# pause-menu: the pause panel and its glyph rows. 33 presents carry 462
# interpolated triangles in 99 runs, every run carried by its own translation,
# no crossed pair. This is the Spyro 1 leg of the 2D-carry translation, which
# had no manifest on this game.
#
# beast-makers-wild-flight-text at 3305-3315 was tried and reads lerped=0 over
# 33 presents: the flight timer's glyphs are rebuilt rather than carried, so
# the carry pairs nothing there and the row measures nothing.
pause-menu.bk2 | 1800-1810 | lerps=400
